ts own plant; consideration not disclosed.","**Tipco Engineering** -- Board approves raising its Ranks Precision buyout to 100% (from 50%) for Rs 29.14 cr, and converts its proposed Hanutech Engineering partnership into an outright slump-sale purchase of the business; price not disclosed."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 75 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Om Infra** -- H1 FY27 standalone EBITDA up 98.73% YoY to Rs 27.98 cr, PAT up 87.54% to Rs 13.91 cr, revenue up 15.36% to Rs 245.12 cr.","**Physicswallah** -- outlines its FY30 ambition at its first Investor Day: revenue of Rs 9,000-10,000 cr (from Rs 3,900 cr in FY26), 25%+ revenue CAGR FY27-FY30, 20%+ pre-Ind AS EBITDA margin.","**Puravankara** -- launches Purva Cityspire in Kochi, 1,056 homes across six towers, with a GDV of ~Rs 2,000 cr.","**Biocon** -- EU grants marketing authorization for its pertuzumab biosimilar Pebrilzo, the first biosimilar approved under the EMA's new tailored clinical approach; follows the 16-Nov US FDA approval."],"distress_risk":["**DCM Limited** -- Income Tax Department's Section 154 rectification order raises the tax demand on its demerged textile undertaking (now DCM Nouvelle) to Rs 41.66 cr for AY2019-20, up from an earlier Rs 25.89 cr addition.","**JSW Energy** -- wind subsidiaries win an APTEL appeal against an APERC order; Discoms must now pay the generic tariff instead of the lower Rs 0.50/unit CUF-penalty rate, plus interest; amount not quantified."],"other_notable":["**Genus Power Infrastructures** -- completes its Rs 148.20 cr tender-offer buyback of 47,50,000 shares at Rs 312 each.","**Infinium Pharmachem** -- receives NSE's in-principle approval to migrate its shares from the EMERGE (SME) platform to the Main Board."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)